  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Baldev Singh vs Hy.State on 29 May, 2019 Author: Anupinder Singh Grewal Bench: Anupinder Singh Grewal In The High Court Of Punjab And Haryana At Chandigarh 207 Crr-815-1987 Date Of Decision: 29.05.2019 Baldev Singh ... Petitioner(s) Versus State Of Haryana ... Respondent(s) Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Anupinder Singh Grewal Present: Ms. Simranjeet Kaur, Advocate for the petitioner. Mr. D.R. Singla, Dag, Haryana. ** ** Anupinder Singh Grewal, J. (Oral)",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "She contends that the adulterated khoya is stated to have been recovered from the petitioner on 21.08.1980 which was found to be containing milk fat below the minimum prescribed standard. Learned counsel for the petitioner contends that she had sent a letter to the petitioner which was received back with the remarks that the petitioner has expired.",
